// WHEN A MARK MAY NEXT SPAWN, as a map_clock deadline. scope=perm because Old School says
// "this timer persists even after logging out or changing worlds".
//
// map_clock is world uptime and resets when the server restarts, so a deadline saved before
// a restart would sit in the future for ever and silently switch marks off. ~agility_mark_roll
// treats a deadline further away than the wait itself as stale and rolls anyway.
[mark_grace_cooldown]
scope=perm
